* A verified external library that explicitly implements the native 3-node ABI.
* The internal ALB uses the same D_LOGIC_BLOCK buffer compiled to SRALB0.
.subckt SR_NATIVE_DIGITAL_BUFFER D D_SINK D_SOURCE Q Q_SINK Q_SOURCE
Xcore D D_SINK D_SOURCE Q Q_SINK Q_SOURCE SRALB0
.ends SR_NATIVE_DIGITAL_BUFFER
